o account. Houses near fields? Great. Monuments next to forests? Maybe not the best idea...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple rules and a clean look, the game offers a calm experience\u2014perfect for those seeking something relaxing yet challenging. No ticking clock. No pressure. Just you, the map, and your ability to plan and adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjacency logic</strong>: each building has positive and negative affinities with others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle meets strategy</strong>: think before placing, and maximize your score.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing and minimalist style</strong>: play at your own pace with a clean interface and soothing visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Scoring system</strong>: challenge yourself and find the most efficient layout.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save and continue later</strong>: build your village gradually, no rush.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy logic games, building, and a good dose of tranquility, this is the perfect game for you. Get ready to place tiles, explore combinations, and create something beautiful and functional\u2014one block at a time.</p>","developers":["codegamerstudio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677420/ff8690b9e2d3860f6c403a6428ef323c88dabb6f/header.jpg?t=1759705940","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"m